#X text 240 83 The object is a simple array player designed to work
together with the [vline~] object. Instead of producing audio itself
\, it outputs control messages that drive [vline~] \, which in turn
generates the reading index for the array. The playback range is set
with the range method or the @begin and @end properties. The object
also supports reversed playback and variable speed.;
